========================================================================
  BLUE/BLACK: THE HIDDEN STRUCTURE
========================================================================

  BLUE/BLACK SYMMETRY CHECK:
  W_bb symmetric: True

  BLUE/BLACK ROW SUMS (= H of complement class):
    H= 1: row_sum=1, fiber×H=1, match=True
    H= 3: row_sum=6, fiber×H=6, match=True
    H= 3: row_sum=3, fiber×H=3, match=True
    H= 5: row_sum=50, fiber×H=50, match=True
    H= 9: row_sum=81, fiber×H=81, match=True
    H= 9: row_sum=81, fiber×H=81, match=True
    H=11: row_sum=121, fiber×H=121, match=True
    H=13: row_sum=169, fiber×H=169, match=True
    H=15: row_sum=75, fiber×H=75, match=True
    H=15: row_sum=45, fiber×H=45, match=True

  KEY IDENTITY: blue/black row sum = fiber × H
  Because each tiling's tournament has H HPs, and each HP
  of T^op gives one blue/black target tiling.

